('CODING','Write a SOQL query that retrieves all Contacts related to Accounts in a specific industry, using a relationship query.','',NULL,'SELECT Id, Name FROM Contact WHERE Account.Industry = ''Technology''','Easy','SOQL',NULL,'salesforce','Apex',true),
