('CODING','Diagnose why an ABAP report is running slowly against a large table and propose a fix.','',NULL,'Check for a SELECT * without needed field restriction, a missing WHERE clause using an indexed field, or nested SELECTs inside a loop (should be a single JOIN or FOR ALL ENTRIES instead); use SAT/SE30 to profile and confirm the actual bottleneck.','Hard','Performance',NULL,'sap','ABAP',true),
('CODING','Write ABAP code using FOR ALL ENTRIES correctly to avoid a common performance and duplicate-row pitfall.','',NULL,'Always check the driver internal table is not empty before the SELECT (FOR ALL ENTRIES against an empty table returns ALL rows), and use SELECT DISTINCT or post-process to remove duplicates FOR ALL ENTRIES can introduce.','Medium','ABAP Performance',NULL,'sap','ABAP',true),

